{
  "name": "Answer WhatsApp messages with an AI agent and hand over to a person",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Answer WhatsApp messages with an AI agent and hand over to a person\n\n### How it works\nA customer writes to your WhatsApp Business number and an AI agent answers from the same number within seconds. The Cosend Trigger fires on Message Received (message.received, Message Types: Text) and, while no person has taken over, the AI Agent node reads the message and Message › Send replies into the same conversation. When a person should take over, the agent calls the Cosend node as a tool: Conversation › Set Control (Passed to a Person) marks the chat as waiting in the Cosend inbox, and your team answers from there or from the phone.\n\n### Setup\nSelf-hosted n8n with the n8n-nodes-cosend community node (version tested 2026.11.1; install guide at cosend.app/docs/n8n). A Cosend account on any plan, including Free, with a connection API key in the Cosend API credential. A chat model credential. Describe your business in the system message.\n\n### Customization\nChange the system prompt, add your website as a knowledge tool, or post to Slack on each handover.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e01",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Answer with AI\nEach conversation keeps its own memory. **Pass to my team** is the Cosend node working as a tool: the agent calls it when a customer needs a person. **Reply on WhatsApp** sends the agent's answer into the chat.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e02",
      "name": "Answer with AI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "message.received"
        ],
        "filters": {
          "messageTypes": [
            "text"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e04",
      "name": "When a WhatsApp message arrives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the friendly WhatsApp assistant for our business. Answer in the customer's language, in short messages that read well on a phone. Use plain text, without markdown.\n\nAbout the business: describe what you sell, your opening hours, your address and how to book here.\n\nWhen the customer asks for a person, wants to complain, or asks something you cannot answer from the text above, call the tool that passes the conversation to the team, then tell the customer a person will reply here soon."
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e05",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e06",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e07",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        860,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Pass this WhatsApp conversation to a person on the team. Use it when the customer asks for a person, wants to complain, or asks something you cannot answer.",
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "setControl",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "control": "pending_human",
        "controlOptions": {
          "reason": "={{ $fromAI('reason', 'Why the customer needs a person, in one short sentence', 'string') }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e08",
      "name": "Pass to my team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e09",
      "name": "Reply on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "get",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c1",
      "name": "Who is answering",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.control }}",
              "rightValue": "bot",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c2",
      "name": "No person has taken over",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New message, if no person has taken over\nThe workflow answers only while the bot is in charge. Once it passes a chat to your team, someone picks it up in the Cosend inbox, or you reply from the WhatsApp Business app, it stays quiet.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c4",
      "name": "New message, if no person has taken over",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -200
      ]
    }
  ],
